Processes payment requests as authorized. Sends payment files per published schedule. Reconciles general ledger and accounts payable data. Communicates with garnishment agency as needed
Generates reconciliation reports and resolves any identified discrepancies to ensure accuracy. Conducts periodic and required audits. Identifies and reconciles corrections as needed. Remits final period end reports and interfaces
