Use appropriate social media platforms to effectively leverage media opportunities in television, print and radio and successfully promote partnerships and community-based events.
Collaborates with multimedia specialist to generate video stories, highlights and live videos for social media.
Collaborates with internal and external communications manager(s) to maximize social media opportunities that help build our brand, increase volume and improve culture.
Responsible for tracking and reporting metrics on social media engagement across all platforms.
Works with marketing teams to understand locally-based opportunities that can be used for division-wide messages on social media platforms.
Attends and participates in departmental meetings.
May represent the department on cross-functional teams and/or task forces within the division.
May occasionally work, help volunteer and/or represent the company at events held during the day, evening or weekends.', 1, CAST(N'2025-06-20T05:22:34.1666667' AS DateTime2), CAST(N'2025-06-20T05:22:34.1666667' AS DateTime2))
INSERT [dbo].[essential_functions_original] ([id], [job_id], [function_text], [sort_order], [created_at], [updated_at]) VALUES (180, 46, N'Conducts long-term monitoring in epilepsy and intensive/critical care units
Measures neurological responses to external stimuli and traces electrical pathways
