Maintains accurate archive and retrieval systems for original EEG tracings
Attends monthly staff meetings
Attends other meetings as requested', 1, CAST(N'2025-06-20T05:22:35.7900000' AS DateTime2), CAST(N'2025-06-20T05:22:35.7900000' AS DateTime2))
INSERT [dbo].[essential_functions_original] ([id], [job_id], [function_text], [sort_order], [created_at], [updated_at]) VALUES (181, 47, N'Utilize a material warehouse management system to ascertain catalog number, size, color, and quantity of merchandise to be picked from bins, shelves, or locations
Select and obtain necessary packing materials to pick orders
Utilize material handling equipment, safely and efficiently, to transport product to shipping locations or delivery platforms and ensuring orders are staged for delivery
Complete pre-shift equipment inspection as required; report any unsafe conditions to management
