•  Able to work independently with minimal supervision
•  Demonstrates the ability to interact with public and staff on all levels while possessing a positive attitude
•  Ability to demonstrate excellent organizational skills and with attention to detail
•  Must be able to read, write and speak conversational English
•  Basic computer skills and knowledge of Microsoft Office

Education
• Associate Preferred

Field of Study
• N/A

Experience
• 2+ Experience with CMS and AHJ (local, state, federal) Preferred

Licenses and Certifications
• Driver''s License (DL) Required

Additional Licenses and Certifications
• N/A', NULL, 0, 11, CAST(N'2025-06-20T05:21:26.2933333' AS DateTime2), 1, CAST(N'2025-06-20T05:21:26.2933333' AS DateTime2), CAST(N'2025-06-20T05:21:26.2933333' AS DateTime2))
