• N/A

Additional Licenses and Certifications
• Certification in HVAC/R, Electrical, Plumbing or other building trades  Required', NULL, 0, 11, CAST(N'2025-06-20T05:22:02.6666667' AS DateTime2), 1, CAST(N'2025-06-20T05:22:02.6666667' AS DateTime2), CAST(N'2025-06-20T05:22:02.6666667' AS DateTime2))
