• Board certification in pharmacotherapy  Preferred', NULL, 0, 1, CAST(N'2025-06-20T05:22:04.4100000' AS DateTime2), 1, CAST(N'2025-06-20T05:22:04.4100000' AS DateTime2), CAST(N'2025-06-20T05:22:04.4100000' AS DateTime2))
