e, Skills, and Abilities
• Ability to communicate effectively and work with people of various backgrounds Required
•  Ability to work independently and within a team environment Required
•  Ability to work in a fast-paced environment, able to budget ones own time and activities as needed to accomplish the tasks at hand, with ability to meet daily deadlines. Ability to follow a schedule and instructions Required
•  Ability to pick orders, identify and sort items, count accurately and determine the correct unit of measure Required
•  Ability to read and write in English Required
•  Attention to detail Required
•  Ability to learn and operate Warehouse Management System (WMS) technologies Required
•  Ability to learn to operate new Material Handling Equipment (MHE) Required
•  Computer skills and ability to work with the latest technology in picking/pulling/staging and cross-docking orders Required
•  Knowledge of a variety of basic topics, such as math, reading, basic accounting, typing, etc. Required

Education
• High School Grad or Equiv Required

