• in a business-related field

Experience
• Prior experience working in distribution a plus Required
•  Prior experience working in a production/goal-oriented environment Required
•  Material Handling Equipment (MHE) experience- Reach Truck, Order Picker, Powered Pallet-jack, Forklift Required
•  Warehouse Management System (WMS) experience Required

