• N/A

Additional Licenses and Certifications
• N/A', NULL, 0, 1, CAST(N'2025-06-20T05:22:37.9900000' AS DateTime2), 1, CAST(N'2025-06-20T05:22:37.9900000' AS DateTime2), CAST(N'2025-06-20T05:22:37.9900000' AS DateTime2))
