s are maintained and actively participating in outstanding customer service. Contributes to maintaining relationships that are equally respectful to all.', N'Responsible for supervising the operations of the support personnel to ensure smooth, efficient, and courteous service to customers, partners, and team members. This position carefully and courteously handles customer interactions to preserve customer confidence. Additionally, this role provides knowledge of HIPAA regulations as needed and communicates with partners, customers, and team members regarding imaging support services. In addition, this position utilizes the hospital performance improvement process in the goals of support services and establishes and maintains ethical working relationships and good rapport with all referring physicians, hospital, and commercial agencies. Responsibilities for this role include meeting with team members to assure service levels are maintained and actively participating in outstanding customer service. Contributes to maintaining relationships that are equally respectful to all.', N'Knowledge, Skills, and Abilities
• Ability to ensure compliance with regulatory and requirements Required
•  Ability to communicate appropriately and effectively with patients and their family, hospital staff, nurses, physicians, and other health care professionals Required
•  Knowledge of commonly used concepts, practices, and procedures in the health care industry Required
•  Ability to multitask Required
•  Must be able to read, write and speak conversational English Required
