•  Medical terminology Preferred
•  Expertise in data analysis and spreadsheet development Preferred
•  Proficient with computer programs and ability to quickly learn various healthcare systems Required
•  Demonstrates interpersonal skills by effectively communicating with all customers, internal and external Required
•  Displays professional interactions with all levels of internal and external customers as demonstrated by work history and interview process Required
•  Excellent written, verbal, and interpersonal communication skills Required
•  Ability to coordinate workflow, staff, and physicians across multiple departments and work with people of diverse backgrounds Required
•  Strong leadership and customer service skills Required
•  Proven ability to lead a team with the ability to supervise others Required
•  Action-oriented, adaptable, solution-driven and innovative Required
•  Ability to learn and grow with new technology Required
•  Excellent critical thinking, problem-solving, and organizational skills Required

