•  Ability to use sound judgment in emergency scenarios Required
•  Ability to delegate clinical tasks/assign clinical activities in order to implement plans of care Required
•  Must be able to read, write and speak conversational English Required
•  Basic computer skills and knowledge of Microsoft Office Required
•  Knowledge of a reporting structure for Mammography" Required

