•  Exhibits familiarity with shipping and billing procedures. Required
•  Ability to meet deadlines and prioritize departmental priorities Required
•  Ability to process large shipments in an organized manner Required
•  Demonstrated ability to use an ERP system. Preferred
•  Understanding of receiving processes and basic materials management. Preferred
•  Ability to operate material handling equipment. Preferred

