tion completes necessary paperwork or computer software tasks to account for inventory movement. Additionally, this role serves as a representative of the supply chain to clinicians, providing excellent customer service and collaborating with customers to manage the supply replenishment process and par level changes. In addition, this position assists in picking and delivering supplies to departments upon request. Additionally, this role picks up items for return and maintains the general upkeep of the inventory storeroom. Ensures efficient and accurate performance of all assigned duties.', N'Knowledge, Skills, and Abilities
