ed areas. Ensures efficient and accurate performance of all assigned duties.', N'Responsible for receiving incoming supplies and equipment and managing the supply replenishment process of par locations. This position puts away supplies in the storeroom, scans receiving documents, delivers supplies to departments, handles returns to suppliers, tags equipment, and completes all associated computer software tasks to ensure accurate record keeping. Additionally, this role straightens, counts, picks, and stocks supplies for specific areas, then completes any paperwork or computer software tasks needed to account for inventory movement. In addition, this position serves as the materials gatekeeper for the hospital, ensuring the facility only pays for items that are actually received. This role also represents the supply chain to nurses and other clinicians in their assigned areas. Ensures efficient and accurate performance of all assigned duties.', N'Knowledge, Skills, and Abilities
